<title>UK: Granada seeks hotel chief - paper.</title>
<headline>Granada seeks hotel chief - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granada Group Plc appointed head-hunters to find a chief for its Forte hotels division as part of its hotel operations, the Financial Times said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The paper said it was unclear whether the new recruit would replace Patrick Copeland, chief executive of Forte hotels, or would occupy a new position above Copeland.</p>
<p>It said Granada, which acquired Forte last year, would not comment. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
